SF0093 Tribal trust land sales and use tax exemption.
Sponsored By: Select Committee on Tribal Relations
AN ACT relating to sales and use tax; providing an exemption for sales and
purchases sourced to trust lands held by only one (1) tribe; and providing for
an effective date.
